==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʁœntgən/|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|röntgt|röntgte|geröntgt}}

# to [[X-ray]]
#: ''[[Gepäckstück]] geröntgt. Gepäckstück nicht [[geöffnet]].'' Piece of baggage x-rayed. Piece of baggage not opened. (Tag found on baggage on returning from Germany.)

====Usage notes====
The inflected forms in which the verb stem ''röntg-'' is followed by a consonant, are usually realized [ʁœntç-] in order to simplify pronunciation. This simplification is not limited to those (nothern and central German) accents that feature a general merger of ''-g'' and ''-ch'' in coda positions.

